        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka oyo nguwenya, kumatalikilo aabwami bwa-Zedekiya mwami wa-Juda, mumwaka wane, mumwezi wasanu, Hananiya mwana wa-Azuri musinsimi waku-Gibeoni wakandaambila muŋanda yaJehova mumatwi aabapaizi abantu boonse, wati, ",
