        {
          "text": "Lino musinsimi uusinsima makani aacoolwe, ijwi lyamusinsimi oyo litaangune kuzuzikizigwa, elyo kuyoozibwa kuti ncobeni Jehova nguwakamutuma oyo musinsimi.",
