        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Hananiya wakaamba mumatwi aabantu boonse kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Mbubonya obo mbunti tyole ijoko lya-Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni lili kunsingo yamisyobo yoonse, myaka yobile niitana kumana. Lino Jeremiya musinsimi wakaya kulinguwe.",
          "type": "text",
