        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli. Ansingo zyabantu bamisyobo eyi yoonse buyo ndabika ijoko lyalubulo, kuti bamanine Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni milimo. Ncobeni bayoomumanina milimo, abalo banyama bamusokwe boonse buyo ndabaaba mumaanza aakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
